Hugeicons, the free stroke-rounded set, from @iconify-json/hugeicons 1.2.35 (MIT, see LICENSE). Every UI icon
comes from it. Copy new ones with tools/hugeicons.sh.

File icons live in ../file-icons: the Material Icon Theme (PKief/vscode-material-icon-theme, MIT, see
../file-icons/LICENSE), as acepe maps them. Only the icons src/file_icon.rs names are copied.
